   :circumstances ["Your governess left in the summer and none has been engaged since; you read and practise on your own, and come down to dinner, though no one has yet thought to consult you about the house." "Your mother has begun planning your presentation at Court next spring and your London season: a Court dress, a coming-out ball, and endless talk of who is to be invited."]}
